msgstr "您的网站名称在分享预览中的显示方式。"

msgid "Meta keywords"
msgstr "元关键词"

msgid "Google has ignored these since 2009, but some other engines and directories still read them."
msgstr "Google 自 2009 年起就忽略它们，但其他一些引擎和目录仍会读取。"

