#: src/Admin/StatsCard.php
msgid "Counted by a small signal the browser sends after the page has loaded, so it works with page caches and CDNs too. No cookie, no IP address and nothing personal is kept: only how many visits each language and page had each day, and the language of the visitor's browser. Robots, search engines and you (the administrators) are not counted. Days older than 400 are deleted by themselves."
msgstr "通过浏览器在页面加载后发送的一个小信号来统计，因此在页面缓存和 CDN 下也有效。不保存 Cookie、IP 地址或任何个人信息：只保存每种语言和每个页面每天的访问次数，以及访客浏览器的语言。机器人、搜索引擎和你们（管理员）不计入。超过 400 天的数据会自动删除。"

#: src/Admin/StatsCard.php
